    "text": "By Omari Fleming ,\n22 hours ago A Mira Mesa man was among 19 people, including two Americans, killed by the Philippine military last month. Lyle Prijoles was a human rights activist who often traveled to the Philippines. \"He was quiet, but very caring,\" said his wife Marienne Cuison, who spoke to NBC 7 from the Philippines. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 9",
